@startuml

title Saga: the two failure policies a definition chooses between

hide empty description
[*] --> running
running --> running : a step completes
running --> completed : the last step completes
running --> compensating : a step fails\n(policy: compensate)
compensating --> compensated : every completed step\nwas compensated in reverse
running --> failed : a step fails\n(policy: stop and retry),\nor a deadline expires
failed --> running : retry from the failed step
completed --> [*]
compensated --> [*]
@enduml
